WEBVTT

00:08:59.326 --> 00:09:02.621
So I wanted to show you
some of my favorite genres

00:09:02.663 --> 00:09:04.957
of comments that I got.

00:09:04.999 --> 00:09:06.166
So this first one,

00:09:06.208 --> 00:09:09.628
we have what I call the honest critic,
just offering a critique.

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:11.380
OK, so he starts,

00:09:11.422 --> 00:09:13.674
“It was funny at first
but then she ruined it.”

00:09:13.716 --> 00:09:15.467
OK, all right, let's hear him out.

00:09:15.509 --> 00:09:17.678
Someone said, "Please elaborate."

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:19.054
(Laughter)

00:09:19.096 --> 00:09:21.307
All right, you have criticism,
let's hear it.

00:09:22.266 --> 00:09:24.059
"She kept yappin' about the tampons."

00:09:24.101 --> 00:09:25.769
(Laughter)

00:09:25.811 --> 00:09:27.563
And you know what? Fair.

00:09:27.605 --> 00:09:29.398
So, you know, I'm going to take that.

00:09:29.398 --> 00:09:32.943
I mean, to be honest, the tampons
is sort of a central part of the song.